ty ;CGO’06)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-fast-and-effective-orchestration-of-compiler-optimizationszhelong-panrudolf-eigenmannpurdue-university-cgo06/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-fast-and-effective-orchestration-of-compiler-optimizationszhelong-panrudolf-eigenmannpurdue-university-cgo06/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fast and Effective Orchestration of Compiler Optimizations&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="저자"&gt;저자&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%80%ec%9e%90" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zhelong Pan,Rudolf Eigenmann&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="motivation"&gt;Motivation&lt;a href="#motivation" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;compile-time optimizations 은 전반적으로 프로그램 성능을 향상시키지만 일부 기법은 성능 하락을 야기한다.&#10;입력프로그램와 target architecture에 대한 불충분한 정보는 컴파일 시간에 정확도 향상을 향상 시키는 모델의 한계를 만든다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>간단논문 정리 TVM An Automated End-to-End Optimizing Compiler for Deep Learning (OSDI 18)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-tvm-an-automated-end-to-end-optimizing-compiler-for-deep-learning-osdi-18/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-tvm-an-automated-end-to-end-optimizing-compiler-for-deep-learning-osdi-18/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10; alt="TVM 스택 도식. PyTorch·CoreML·TensorFlow·ONNX·Keras·MXNet 이 High-Level Differentiable IR 로 들어오고, Tensor Expression 과 최적화 탐색 공간을 거쳐 LLVM·CUDA·Metal 과 VTA 로 내려가며, AutoTVM 이 디바이스 플릿과 주고받으며 탐색한다"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/tvm1.png"&#10; data-gallery-alt="TVM 스택 도식. PyTorch·CoreML·TensorFlow·ONNX·Keras·MXNet 이 High-Level Differentiable IR 로 들어오고, Tensor Expression 과 최적화 탐색 공간을 거쳐 LLVM·CUDA·Metal 과 VTA 로 내려가며, AutoTVM 이 디바이스 플릿과 주고받으며 탐색한다"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>논문 정리 NeuroVectorizer End-to-End Vectorization with Deep Reinforcement Learning (CGO 20)</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-neurovectorizer-end-to-end-vectorization-with-deep-reinforcement-learning-cgo-20/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC-neurovectorizer-end-to-end-vectorization-with-deep-reinforcement-learning-cgo-20/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10; alt="NeuroVectorizer 프레임워크 개요 도식의 축소판"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://jaehun.me/assets/images/nv1.png"&#10; data-gallery-alt="NeuroVectorizer 프레임워크 개요 도식의 축소판"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="제목"&gt;제목&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%9c%eb%aa%a9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;NeuroVectorizer: End-to-End Vectorization with Deep Reinforcement Learning&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>